# exclude data from source control by default — except the DVC pointers.
#
# The .dvc files are a few hundred bytes each and they ARE the record of which
# data version a training run used: without them in the repository, a teammate
# who clones has nothing to `dvc pull` with, and the hashes in MLflow point at
# nothing they can retrieve.
#
# Four lines rather than one, because git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded. `/data/` plus `!data/preprocessed/*.dvc` silently does
# nothing: the negation never gets a chance to match. Each level has to be
# re-included on the way down.
/data/*
!/data/preprocessed/
/data/preprocessed/*
!/data/preprocessed/*.dvc

# Mac OS-specific storage files
.DS_Store

# vim
*.swp
*.swo

# Mypy cache
.mypy_cache/

